[en.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_I]
Ponyville Reconstruction

[en.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_I_desc]
Every artist needs a blank canvas. To truly build something, you must first tear down what is already there.
Now, the reconstruction of Ponyville begins, and the Unity Committee will take over everything.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_I]
小马谷重建计划

[zh.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_I_desc]
每个艺术家都需要一块空白的画布。要真正建立一些东西，你必须首先摧毁已经存在的。
现在，小马谷的重建开始了，团结委员会将接管一切。
